ls on qBackwardCompatible."Echo "#"Echo "#     Or"Echo "#"Echo "# Run these scripts to (almost) fully convert your code to R13 coding style and constructs:"Echo "#"Echo "#     RunCanon R13.dict            - Change method names automatically"Echo "#     RunCanon AGA.dict            - Change Gray Council class & method names automatically (optional, only if you use AGA)"Echo "#     FindChangedDataMembers       - List data members that should be replaced with accessors in your source code"Echo "#     FindChangedHeaders           - List obsolete header files in your source code"Echo "#     FindChangedTObject           - List references to TObject in your source code"Echo "#     FindCompatibleChangedMethods - List changed methods in your source code that qBackwardCompatible would define"Echo "RunCanon :R13.dict ∂"{conversionDir}∂""Echo "RunCanon :AGA.dict ∂"{conversionDir}∂""Echo "FindChangedDataMembers  ∂"{conversionDir}∂""Echo "FindChangedHeaders ∂"{conversionDir}∂""Echo "FindChangedTObject ∂"{conversionDir}∂""Echo "FindCompatibleChangedMethods ∂"{conversionDir}∂""